sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant UI as Dashboard
  participant API as FastAPI /api/inspect
  participant M as YOLOv8n
  participant S as SQLite + thumbnails
  U->>UI: choose image, set confidence
  UI->>API: POST image + confidence
  API->>API: decode image (400 if not an image)
  API->>M: predict(image, confidence)
  M-->>API: boxes, classes, confidences
  API->>API: verdict = FAIL if any box, else PASS
  API->>S: INSERT inspection row
  API->>S: save annotated 480 px thumbnail
  API-->>UI: id, verdict, defects, ms
  UI->>UI: draw boxes on canvas, show verdict
  Note over UI,S: History, Overview and CSV export read from the same log
